💡 **SUGGESTION: fold the duplicated boot/teardown scaffolding into `_boot`**

`_boot` already owns construction, but every one of the four tests repeats the same three lines:

```dart
final (model, program, run) = await _boot(sink);
addTearDown(() async {
  program.kill();
  await run;
});
```

Registering the teardown inside `_boot` (the helper can call `addTearDown` itself — it runs inside the test zone) removes ~12 lines of copy-paste and makes it impossible for a future fifth test to forget the kill. Same shape as `program_survival_test.dart`'s `addTearDown(program.kill)`, just centralized.

